		{
			"id": "TTRRzH3Jv8mXytOeZ",
			"name": "Scourge Wings",
			"local_notes": "Lore: Grafted wings that let a Drukhari raider take to the air. Codex: Drukhari's Scourge background.\n\nDesign: 30 + 10 = 40 points.",
			"tags": [
				"Advantage",
				"Physical",
				"Xenos",
				"Drukhari"
			],
			"container_type": "meta_trait",
			"children": [
				{
					"id": "todWCcneuaJoWqO5F",
					"name": "Flight (Winged)",
					"reference": "B56",
					"local_notes": "Air Move 2 x Basic Move (18 at Move 9).\n\nLore: Scourges pay a Haemonculus to graft on wings and take to the air as raiders and scouts. Codex: Drukhari's Scourge background; the wings' surgical origin is background across editions.\n\nDesign: Flight (B56, 40 points) with Winged -25%: 40 x 0.75 = 30 points.",
					"tags": [
						"Advantage",
						"Physical",
						"Xenos",
						"Drukhari"
					],
					"modifiers": [
						{
							"id": "mt379LWiPORqdo8U_",
							"name": "Winged",
							"reference": "B56",
							"local_notes": "Needs room to spread the wings; a Scourge cannot fly cramped, and a hit to a wing can ground them.",
							"cost_adj": "-25%"
						}
					],
					"base_points": 40
				},
				{
					"id": "t_wAsA39JfjSLwgJ2",
					"name": "Enhanced Move (Air)",
					"reference": "B52",
					"local_notes": "Top sprinting speed x1.5 in flight.\n\nLore: Scourges dive on their targets faster than a Guardian can run.\n\nDesign: Enhanced Move (Air) 1/2 (B52, 20/level, 10 points): Air Move 18 with x1.5 top speed, 27, well past the framework's 'Air 20+'.",
					"tags": [
						"Advantage",
						"Physical",
						"Xenos",
						"Drukhari"
					],
					"points_per_level": 20,
					"can_level": true,
					"levels": 0.5
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": "t27HjKjXP5aWEP_sL",
			"name": "Callous",
			"reference": "B125",
			"local_notes": "Indifferent to others' pain; -3 reaction when it shows.\n\nLore: Even a Drukhari who does not enjoy suffering treats it as currency. Background.\n\nDesign: Callous (B125, -5).",
			"tags": [
				"Disadvantage",
				"Mental",
				"Xenos",
				"Drukhari"
			],
			"base_points": -5
		},
		{
			"id": "t4odtjhJcJyu0keUW",
			"name": "Selfish",
			"reference": "B153",
			"local_notes": "Puts own gain over the group's; self-control roll to share loot or hold a post.\n\nLore: A Kabalite's loyalty is to their own advancement first. Background.\n\nDesign: Selfish (B153, -5) with self-control 12.",
			"tags": [
				"Disadvantage",
				"Mental",
				"Xenos",
				"Drukhari"
			],
			"base_points": -5,
			"cr": 12
		},
		{
			"id": "tmiTUSphn5d53hp07",
			"name": "Overconfidence",
			"reference": "B148",
			"local_notes": "Overrates their own ability and underrates opposition; self-control roll to hold back from a risky show of strength.\n\nLore: Arena stars, aerial raiders and Kabal nobles all believe themselves the best in the room. Background.\n\nDesign: Overconfidence (B148, -5) with self-control 12.",
			"tags": [
				"Disadvantage",
				"Mental",
				"Xenos",
				"Drukhari"
			],
			"base_points": -5,
			"cr": 12
		},
		{
			"id": "tRPq4OJw2XWvs3x0B",
			"name": "Power from Pain (Stage I)",
			"reference": "B59",
			"local_notes": "High Pain Threshold, once feeding has begun. Stage I of three; each later stage needs the one before it. A stage lapses at the end of the scene.\n\nLore: Every Drukhari fights harder for the taste of blood. Codex background describes the Dark Eldar as growing bolder and stronger as the killing goes on, feeding on the pain they cause; the exact stages differ between Kabals, Wych Cults and Covens.\n\nDesign: High Pain Threshold (B59, 10 points) with Accessibility (B110) -30% for its trigger: 10 x 0.7 = 7 points. Deliberately no `attributes` feature: the bonus is conditional and must not raise the sheet's stats before the trigger.",
			"tags": [
				"Advantage",
				"Physical",
				"Xenos",
				"Drukhari"
			],
			"modifiers": [
				{
					"id": "mdXudtCS8mYxI71RV",
					"name": "Accessibility",
					"reference": "B110",
					"local_notes": "Only after the Drukhari, or a comrade in the same unit, has drawn blood or caused real suffering in this scene.",
					"cost_adj": "-30%"
				}
			],
			"base_points": 10
		}
	],
